KPL/IK

Hayabusa2 TIR Instrument kernel
==============================================================================

   This instrument kernel (I-kernel) file contains detector, optical, and
   field-of-view parameters for the Hayabusa2 Thermal Infrared Imager (TIR)
   instrument.


